OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely bright and sunny after
OL,6,Fa cool start, with showers continuing
OL,7,Fto affect eastern regions. Becoming
OL,8,Fovercast from late afternoon, ahead of
OL,9,Frain arriving in the west by the early
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with rain spreading
OL,13,Feastwards through the region overnight
OL,14,Fwith strengthening winds. The rain
OL,15,Fwill clear from the west but linger
OL,16,Falong the east coast by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
