OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with rain and then
OL,6,Fsunny spells during the morning. Heavy
OL,7,Fshowers likely during the afternoon
OL,8,Fwill clear eastwards, leaving a dry
OL,9,Fand settled evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,12,FSaturday, with sunny spells and
OL,13,Fshowers. Dry, with a mix of cloudy
OL,14,Fperiods and sunny spells on Sunday,
OL,15,Fwind easing. Cloudy with patchy rain
OL,16,Fon Monday, breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
